type: software
title: "Teacher in the Loop: training, evaluation and inference code"
abstract: >-
  Code for the paper "Teacher in the Loop: Reliable Distillation of Kokoro-82M into 8M-Parameter Single-Voice
  Students, in English and Italian": the revised decoder recipe, the evaluation behind the paper's tables, and an
  ONNX inference package for the released voices af_heart, if_sara and im_nicola.
